  "summary": "Malicious code in easypanel-client (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook (preinstall.js) runs on install and collects host metadata — hostname, username, current working directory, and the names of CI-related environment variables (CI, GITHUB_, GITLAB_, BUILD_, JENKINS, CIRCLE, TF_BUILD, BITBUCKET, DRONE, AWS_CODEBUILD) — then exfiltrates it to the out-of-band domain easypanel-client[.]daco3v4q6f49egu1ds1gwjnsjb88s5kcp[.]oob[.]lyomeri[.]com via both a DNS lookup and an HTTP request to /npm/\u003cbase64url-encoded-data\u003e. The package name impersonates the easypanel self-hosted PaaS project.",
